    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Asa ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Abiya wifuula hamò na bakūlūgenji bakwe, ūjīkwa mu nzengo go ng'wa Daūdi. Asa ng'witūnja wakwe wingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe ūbiza ntemi; ū mu shikū jakwe ī sī yifuula ikanza lya myaka ikūmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Asa akīīta yawiza ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA ū Mulungu wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyīnja pyī ī myalīlo ya bamulungu bageni, na a mapandī ga higūlya; gaalīho na mawe meela, nago ūgabelagūla; na ng'hīngī ja ng'wa Ashela jalīho, najo ūjibbutagūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba Yuda ūbinha shilagīlo sha kūnkooba SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji babo, na kūshimīzīla ū mu shilagīlo shakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūgīnja a mapandī ga higūlya ayo gaalī gabeejiwa ūko na ūko ū mu mizengo ya Yuda, nī myalīlo īyo yalī yazengwa; ū būtemi būbiza na mhola ū mu shikū jakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī ī sī yalī na mhola, wīzenga būpya ī mizengo īyo yalī īpīndīlījiwe ndugu. Walī atīho nūūlū ūmò ūyo wilwishaga nang'hwe būlūgū ū mu shikū jenījo, nguno ū SEEBA walī wang'winha kwifuula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbawīla a banhū ba Yuda, “Twībeejagi ī mizengo yenīyī, twīpīndīlīje ndugu na numba ja balang'hani, hamò na mibita na malugalīlo gaho. Ī sī yenīyī ītaalī yise nguno twangalūkīlile ū SEEBA Mulungu wise; īkī twangalūkīlile h'ī chene watwinhile mhola būlī kwene.” Na ng'hana būzenga yūūbabeelela ī mihayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Asa walī n'ibità lya bashilikale shihūmbī magana adatū a ba kūfuma mu Yuda, baalī na mūda nhaale na machimu; ū kūfuma ī Benajamini walī nabo shihūmbī magana abīlī na makūmi anaane, a bene baalī na mūda ndo do do, hamò na būta. A bose benaba baalī bashilikale bakalī, batogohaga shose shose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Asa kūmpyena Zeelà",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho Zeelà muna Kushi, wiza n'ibità itaale lya bashilikale kūbadumīla, na magogoteni magana adatū ga būlūgū walī nago; wiza ūtūūla ng'hambī ipandī lya Malesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Asa ūja koi kūjūmanhya nang'hwe; bamba būlūgū mu sī ya ntubīlo gwa Zefata, ū mu Malesha ng'wenūmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Asa ūnīlīīla ū SEEBA Mulungu wakwe alīhaya, “SEEBA, atīho ūngī ūyo abizile gītī bebe, ū mu kūbagunanha abo batī na nguzu ūlū balilwisha na a ba nguzu. Tūgunanhage SEEBA Mulungu wise, nguno tūkūsendamīlile bebe; hama twizaga mu lina lyako ū kwilwisha nī libità ī litaale lyenīlī. Ee SEEBA, ū bebe ūlī Mulungu wise, ūtizūneka munhū ose ose igūngūhye higūlya yako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū SEEBA ūbakenaagūla a Bakushi ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa Asa na a banhū ba Yuda. A Bakushi būpeela, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū Asa nī libità lyakwe būboolomya nhambo kūshisha Geela. A Bakushi bakagwa bingī no, ī libità lyabo lītapandīkile nguzu ja kūgūngūmūka hangī; būbiza baapyenwa gete ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA na a mabità gakwe. A banhū ba Yuda būbūūcha shikolo shingī ū kūfuma ū mu būtindi wenūbo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būgakenaagūla pye a magūngūli ayo gaalī gīpīndīlīgije ī Geela, nguno baalī na lyogohya lya ng'wa SEEBA; nīyo bakasola shikolo shingī ū kūfuma ū mu magūngūli genayo, nguno shalīmo shikolo shingī no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būjidumīla na ng'hambī ja badīīmi, būtula madaale mataale ga ng'holo na mbūli na ngamīla; hūna būshoka Yelusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
